\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. To Thee our God we fly,
\par For mercy and for grace;
\par O hear our lowly cry,
\par And hide not Thou Thy face!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord, stretch forth Thy mighty hand,
\par And guard and bless our fatherland.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Arise, O Lord of Hosts;
\par Be jealous for Thy name,
\par And drive from out our coasts
\par The sins that put to shame.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord, stretch forth Thy mighty hand,
\par And guard and bless our fatherland.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thy best gifts from on high
\par In rich abundance pour,
\par That we may magnify
\par And praise Thee more and more.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord, stretch forth Thy mighty hand,
\par And guard and bless our fatherland.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The powers ordained by Thee
\par With heavenly wisdom bless;
\par May they Thy servants be,
\par And rule in righteousness.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord, stretch forth Thy mighty hand,
\par And guard and bless our fatherland.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. The Church of Thy dear Son
\par Inflame with love's pure fire;
\par Bind her once more in one,
\par And life and truth inspire.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord, stretch forth Thy mighty hand,
\par And guard and bless our fatherland.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. The pastors of Thy fold
\par With grace and power endue,
\par That faithful, pure, and bold,
\par They may be pastors true.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord, stretch forth Thy mighty hand,
\par And guard and bless our fatherland.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. O let us love Thy house
\par And sanctify Thy day,
\par Bring unto Thee our vows
\par And loyal homage pay.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord, stretch forth Thy mighty hand,
\par And guard and bless our fatherland.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8. Give peace, Lord, in our time;
\par O let no foe draw nigh,
\par Nor lawless deed of crime
\par Isult Thy majesty.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord, stretch forth Thy mighty hand,
\par And guard and bless our fatherland.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9. Thou weak and wayward, still
\par Thy people, Lord, are we;
\par And for our God we will
\par None other have but Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O Lord, stretch forth Thy mighty hand,
\par And guard and bless our fatherland.
\par Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

